WEBVTT

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:22.150
Far, far away, in a distant time.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:29.160
ln the outer space of this universe
there was a tribe called the Tribe of Gold.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:36.250
They, who created planets and
had the power to foresee the future,

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:39.670
called out to the still-primitive other tribes.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.640
The tribes that responded to their call were

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.850
the Tribe of Silver,

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:00.110
the Tribe of Bronze,

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:03.900
the Tribe of Hero,

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:12.120
and the Tribe of Iron.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.500
Before long, the Tribe of Gold left

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.790
this universe for another universe.

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:26.970
After they left,

00:01:27.050 --> 00:01:31.300
the Tribe of Silver
declared itself the successor

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.600
of the Tribe of Gold and
ruled over the other tribes.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.690
And in view of its
possession of the last Nodos,

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:44.610
the Tribe of Silver regarded the Tribe of Iron,
in other words humankind, as their enemy.

00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:46.650
They decided to destroy us.

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:53.580
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni
ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:01:53.660 --> 00:02:00.620
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:20.100
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:27.030
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi
demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:29.150
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:34.160
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:36.080
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:39.580
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.250
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.830
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:52.470
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa
tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:57.760
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:06.150
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita
kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:10.490
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:31.260
Hey, how about this one?

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:33.340
Hmm...

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:37.800
What about something like this?
 Huh? Lemme see it.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.140
Which one should I pick?

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:41.930
The one that'd cheer him up!

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:43.730
He's pretty depressed, you know.

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:44.900
Dhianeila!

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.520
What the heck, Age?!

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:51.440
You scared us!

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:52.360
What is that?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:53.450
Photo.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:03:59.950
Age!

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:01.370
Hey, he said it again!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.290
He's like a kid!

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:06.580
"M-e"?

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:07.830
Yeah, exactly.

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:09.130
You're already 1 6 years old.

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.880
It sounds funny when you
call yourself your own name.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.050
Me...

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:43.250
I wish I was born as a monkey, too.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.580
Don't be so depressed.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:47.120
I hope this will cheer you up, Big Brother.

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:59.010
Just send us the usual amount.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:02.600
I'll pay for them all at the end of the month.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:03.970
There are so many of them!

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:12.110
Iolaous!

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.900
One, two, three.

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.570
Four! Four of us!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:19.070
He can count up to four, now.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:22.200
Nice progress, right? We taught him!

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.700
Why did you bring him here?

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.250
Because we can't stop him.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:28.250
Our power doesn't work on him.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:34.500
Just because he happens to
have the Tribe of Hero within...

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.590
Forget what you saw here!

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:38.970
Got it?

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.760
Iolaous likes Dhianeila!

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:45.640
I just told you to forget about it, didn't I?

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:47.430
Yeah!

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:51.610
I'm sure they're aware that we're
being pursued by the Tribe of Silver.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:52.610
However,

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:55.610
Titarros is a neutral terminal planet.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:57.190
As long as we pay them,

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:59.610
we shouldn't have a problem getting supplies...

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:01.950
So the problem is the Nodos, huh?

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:02.870
Right.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.240
They are neutral,

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:08.580
but technically the Planet Titarros is located
in the area controlled by the Tribe of Silver.

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:12.460
If they find out that we have the Nodos,
they might notify the Tribe of Silver.

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:16.510
I just hope he'll stay
quiet while we're docked...

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:18.550
Nope, not much hope of that.

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:20.010
It is the monkey we're talking about.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:22.970
I'll bet he'll get even more excited
because of the unfamiliar surroundings.

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:26.810
I guess we'll ask the princess
to give him a good talking to.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.740
Don't eat them, okay?

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:42.700
Okay. They're important things for everyone.

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:45.580
That's right. We share them with everyone.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:47.950
The Argonaut has "everyone." It's nice.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:51.040
Oh, right, Age has no family.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:56.960
Dhianeila, Aneasha.

00:06:57.840 --> 00:06:59.090
We've brought him.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.420
Thank you.

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:02.470
It seems that you are always together.

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.390
I just hope that these two
aren't teaching him anything weird.

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.600
Age, we need to talk to you.

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:12.480
What?

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:16.860
This ship will be arriving at
a planet called Titarros soon.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:18.280
Dhianeila's planet?

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:21.610
No. We're still far, far
away from the Altria System.

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.910
We're going to stop at
Titarros to replenish our supplies.

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.240
And regarding that,

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:27.870
we'd like to ask you a favor.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.410
While we're at Titarros,

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.910
can you stay inside the
ship and behave yourself?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.120
When we arrive at Titarros,

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:38.210
even if you want to go outside the ship, I
want you to restrain yourself and stay in.

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.000
Why?

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:40.090
Because...

00:07:40.170 --> 00:07:43.340
We don't want to alarm the
people there unnecessarily.

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:48.100
You know, there's Belcross inside you, right?

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:48.890
Yeah.

00:07:48.930 --> 00:07:51.850
We're okay with that, because
it's helped us many times before,

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:55.270
but the people who don't know
anything about it will be shocked.

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:57.230
So, it's best to keep things
about you secret from them

00:07:57.320 --> 00:08:00.650
and pretend that you're not even on this ship.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.630
It's a Tribe of Iron ship.

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.260
It's requesting clearance to dock here.

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:27.760
A ship from Altria which left
the starway two cycles ago.

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:30.430
Right now they're being
pursued by the Tribe of Silver.

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:34.560
Destroying a ship is an easy
task for the Tribe of Silver...

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:35.770
I'm a little concerned.

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:38.270
Should we notify the Tribe of Silver?

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:40.150
There's no need for that.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:44.360
It'll be sufficient for us
to deal with them appropriately.

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.910
Clearance is granted, Master.

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.490
Ikaros...

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.580
It's not that easy to remain neutral, huh?

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:00.540
Putting just the topsail in sensing mode.

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:01.880
Rise on the count of three.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:07.300
Linking to the station's
original current. Signs stable.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:18.850
Begin approach.

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:23.650
Margin of error on access aisle
0.002%. Correct after three steps.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:31.160
Final sequence in progress.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:34.450
Cruise control, all steps complete.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:47.720
I'm sorry to inconvenience you.

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:54.260
Princess, we've got a problem.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:57.140
Titarros said they'd like
to perform an inspection.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.940
Does that mean they found out about Age?

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:02.690
If that were the case, they
would've refused us entry.

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:06.740
The incident we had with the Tribe of Silver
must've made them a little nervous.

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:09.240
However, once we let
them conduct the inspection,

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.700
it may be difficult for
us to keep on hiding him.

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.620
Let's have him wait on Titarros.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:16.750
You mean, let the Nodos go land on the planet?

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:17.790
Yes.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.160
But

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:22.290
He wouldn't behave violently for no reason.

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:26.710
Babysitting that monkey?

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.130
If anything happens,

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.970
I know you're capable of
bringing him back right away.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.800
That's true, but...

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:34.760
The princess appointed you for this.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:36.560
Understood, Father.

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:37.970
Leave it to me.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.730
I do have a request, though.

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:44.310
Here, you can wear these.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.650
Once you put them on,
they'll take you to Titarros.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:03.420
It's stiff. It feels bad.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.790
It looks good on you, Age.

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:10.420
Thank you.

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:11.590
What are you talking about?

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.300
You're taking me there with you.

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:15.720
If you want to thank
someone, thank the princess.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:18.140
Please follow Iolaous' instructions.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.520
Okay.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:21.560
Here's the first instruction, then.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.060
It's most regrettable,

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:26.520
but we can't teleport with
you without your consent.

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:30.150
If I say "jump," you shut
up and do just that. Got it?

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:31.820
Yeah.
 Hang on.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.660
Hang onto the suit!

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:37.700
It seems like this is harder than a battle.

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:39.410
Ridiculous...

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.660
Well then, Princess.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.250
I'm counting on you.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:45.500
We're going to jump.

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:52.050
Master, that's Titarros' inspection pod.

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.550
How about the data
regarding Planet Olone and Age?

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.970
I've swapped them with dummy data.

00:11:57.050 --> 00:12:01.520
Good. Let's let them
inspect to their heart's content.

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:20.870
He's entered Titarros.

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:43.060
We found out his location, Yuty La.

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:51.150
We're going to test the fifth one.

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:53.190
I hope the person is nice.

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:55.610
According to the Tribe of Gold's prophecy,

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:58.620
the fifth Nodos is
controlled by the Tribe of Iron

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.910
and fights the other four Nodos.

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:02.990
What are you trying to say?

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:05.250
What if he doesn't join us?

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:06.250
Kill him.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:09.420
No, we should talk first.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:12.590
And if it doesn't work,
we'll just force him to give in.

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:17.090
There's no need to let one who
doesn't obey the Tribe of Silver live.

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:20.300
Mehitak, you go.

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:22.720
I don't like to fight.

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:24.310
I'll go.

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:28.190
I'd like to meet the fifth one.

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:35.150
Fine, Karkinos.

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:37.450
But show him no mercy.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:39.570
Is that an order, Yuty?

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.790
Lecty, please.

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:28.000
Are you saying that we should detain the
ship of the Tribe of Iron without preconditions?

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:32.580
With all due respect,
Titarros is a neutral terminal planet.

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:34.840
Could you please give us a reason?

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.210
Reason?

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:48.060
Hey, stop pulling me! What now?

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:53.440
Seriously, maybe a
battle is easier than this...

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:54.980
H-Hey!

00:14:56.730 --> 00:14:59.820
Again? You still have some in your mouth!

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:06.870
Jeez... I'm telling you, this
is the last time! All right?

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:07.740
Yeah!

00:15:07.830 --> 00:15:10.040
Is eating the only thing you ever think about?

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:11.120
Yeah!

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:18.460
Be careful.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:21.420
I'll go and meet our peer. That's all.

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:26.720
Captain.

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:29.430
Something is looking for Age.

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.770
"Something"?

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:32.770
I don't know exactly what it is,

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:34.770
but it's something substantial.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:36.610
That is certainly disturbing.

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.280
In fact, there's a new
development on my side, too.

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:42.780
Titarros just announced that
they're going to detain this ship.

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.070
Looks like the Tribe of Silver
has gotten to them.

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:48.580
We should call back Iolaous
and leave here immediately.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.120
We'll force our way through.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.580
Wait.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:55.000
We should talk to them.
Please try to negotiate with them.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:57.090
Negotiate?
 Right.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:00.420
It seems that they're
also being forced into this.

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.430
Is Iolaous afraid of Age?

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:13.730
That's ridiculous.

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.350
There's nothing I'm afraid of.

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.440
Why did you ask me such a question?

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:25.740
You said it'd be better if
Age wasn't on the Argonaut.

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:30.240
Age likes Iolaous.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:32.080
Age likes the Argonaut.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:35.000
There are many voices, and it's fun.

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:37.500
Dhianeila's voice is a warm light.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.920
Aneasha is the morning air.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:42.090
Tail and Mail are moving clouds.

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:44.260
Then, I, who am their brother,

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:47.340
should be something like a gloomy rainy cloud.

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:49.680
Iolaous is...

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:52.180
This is an emergency signal!

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:53.600
We have to go back, Age.

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:05.990
Age!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:15.370
I'm very sorry for this unfortunate
situation, Princess Dhianeila.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:17.750
Please don't let it worry you, Your Excellency.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.670
I'm aware of the circumstances.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:23.420
However, I cannot comply with the
demand to hand over the Argonaut to you.

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:25.300
Allow me to be direct with you.

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:28.340
It is most reckless to
oppose the Tribe of Silver.

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:30.140
You have no chance, whatsoever, of winning.

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:34.770
But we must return home
with our hope, no matter what.

00:17:34.850 --> 00:17:35.980
Hope?

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:41.060
The very last hope that the
Tribe of Gold left for humankind...

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:44.610
The human child protected by the
Tribe of Gold is the one who possesses

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:48.030
the Tribe of Hero within, and will
save humankind from extinction...

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:50.620
The hope you're talking about is...

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:51.700
Nodos?!

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:01.460
You have acquired a Nodos...

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:05.170
You have brought a Nodos into Titarros!

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:10.260
We believe in the Tribe of Gold's
prophecy and in the fifth Nodos,

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:14.680
and we will resist the Tribe of Silver's
plot to annihilate humankind.

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:16.680
We will not compromise or give in!

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:20.810
Are you going to attack us if
we don't approve your departure?

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.900
As soon as we're ready, we will depart.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:28.900
The Daedalus are not a belligerent tribe.

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:31.610
Most likely they'll let us go quietly.

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:32.780
But because of that,

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.030
our reputations are now sullied
with the crime of invading Titarros.

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:38.040
It is unfortunate,

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:42.580
but that gutsiness is what
our princess is all about.

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.840
Her unwavering conviction and strong will...

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:48.460
That is why we believe in her and serve her.

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:49.880
Am I wrong?

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:54.050
Well, it's our turn to make a move.

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:55.760
We'll depart right away.

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:57.220
Yes, sir!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:59.310
That was not a negotiation!

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:01.230
That was obviously a threat!

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:02.520
Absolutely unacceptable behavior!

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.980
Now, now, it's all right.

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:07.480
Sir?
 This is actually better for us.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.780
They threatened us with force.

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:14.200
Even if we elicit a rebuke from the
Tribe of Silver, we have a legitimate defense.

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:16.740
Let them be on their merry way.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:17.950
Understood.

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:22.870
Dhianeila-sama, we don't know where Age is.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:26.000
I see him. He is at...

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:48.520
I'm here for the fifth one.

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:50.610
I am Karkinos.

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:51.610
Age.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:53.400
Come with me, Age.

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:58.660
I just sent you Age's coordinates.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:19:59.490
Thanks.

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:02.580
Supposedly, something
substantial is going after Age.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:04.620
Please hurry and bring him back.

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:05.630
Understood.

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:12.920
We both possess the Tribe of Hero within.

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:14.430
No need for us to fight.

00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:16.180
Dad and the others said Age needs to destroy,

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:21.640
one... two... three... four... four of them.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:25.810
Age!

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:26.940
Who is that?

00:20:27.020 --> 00:20:29.610
An Age who's not Age.

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:40.620
Age!

00:20:56.130 --> 00:21:01.310
Age, who are you trying
to fight against, and why?

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.100
Detecting objects
warping out into our vicinity!

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:08.020
What are they?

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:14.360
Ant heaps, Master!

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.950
Did Titarros send them here?

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:17.570
No, they did not, Captain.

00:21:17.660 --> 00:21:18.950
They didn't?

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:20.570
So that means this is...

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:21.700
Right.

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:24.200
The Tribe of Bronze's ant heaps!

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:25.330
Your Excellency...

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:28.330
They tested us.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:29.830
Tested us?

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:32.130
And we didn't obey their instructions.

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:35.340
You mean in that we failed
to detain the Tribe of Iron?

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:37.380
But that could only have
caused an unnecessary war

00:21:37.470 --> 00:21:40.220
They instructed us to detain
them without any preconditions.

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:44.770
They're doing this just because of that?!

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:48.560
That's right... Just because of that...

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:52.650
The Tribe of Silver wants to
destroy Titarros along with us.

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:34.360
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:34.440 --> 00:22:42.200
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:42.280 --> 00:22:47.240
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:58.090
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:58.170 --> 00:23:10.480
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:21.650
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:21.740 --> 00:23:27.120
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:33.370
Kimi wo aishiteru

00:23:36.590 --> 00:23:39.260
The name of the one that
dwells within him is Lernaea.

00:23:39.340 --> 00:23:42.340
He turned Titarros into a
battleground, and what remained was...

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:45.890
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 5: "The Nodos."
